# 1.1 Your first session
# Beats: launch -> @file reference answered -> inline ! shell command.
# The trim window starts after the startup banner has scrolled away, so the
# banner's provider/model line is never in the shipped frames.
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Type "atomic"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Type "Explain @greeter.ts in two sentences."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 30s
Type "!bun greeter.ts"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Type "Now add a farewell(name) function to greeter.ts."
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 34s
